  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfrac></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mpadded><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>|</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mpadded></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>It is given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Hence, there is only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> elements in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>, which is ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>"
